			<Text>C</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-07T12:20:08" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_c12_girl_01"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>やせいの　ポケモンは
ひとを　おそうことも　ある！▼
だけど　そばに　いれば
なかよくなれるのも　ポケモンよ</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-10T03:19:57" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-10-20T08:41:54" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>野生の　ポケモンは
人を　襲うことも　ある！▼
だけど　そばに　いれば
仲良くなれるのも　ポケモンよ</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-10T03:19:54" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-10-20T08:41:54" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♀
・GRIDX＝51、GRIDZ＝717辺り</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-10-20T08:31:39" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>GIRL</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-10-20T08:38:25" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Importance">
			<Text>C</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-07T12:20:11" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_c12_woman1_01"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>あなたの　ママなら
ポケモンを　やすませて▽
げんきに　するのも　じょうずよね！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-10T03:20:22" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-10-20T08:41:54" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>あなたの　ママなら
ポケモンを　休ませて▽
元気に　するのも　上手よね！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-10T03:20:33" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-10-20T08:41:54" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♀
・GRIDX＝36、GRIDZ＝747辺り</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-10-20T08:32:19" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>WOMAN1</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-10-20T08:38:49" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Importance">
			<Text>C</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-07T12:20:11" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_c12_demo_01"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>もしもーし▼
どうしたの？▼
アララギから　れんらくなんて
すごい　ひさしぶり　じゃない？▼
……　……　……
……　……　……▼
へえ！　ポケモンずかん……
それを　うちの　コに？▼
いいんじゃない！　だって　あたしも
あのコに　たびしてほしいもの！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-16T01:55:36" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-09T05:55:17" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>もしもーし▼
どうしたの？▼
アララギから　連絡なんて
すごい　ひさしぶり　じゃない？▼
……　……　……
……　……　……▼
へえ！　ポケモン図鑑……
それを　うちの　子に？▼
いいんじゃない！　だって　あたしも
あのコに　旅してほしいもの！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-16T01:55:38" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-09T05:55:48" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♀
・オープニングデモ用</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-09T05:51:23" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>MAMA</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-09T05:51:04" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Importance">
			<Text>A</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-07T12:20:15" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#80ffff</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_c12_demo_02"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>で　なあに？　そのコ　ってば
もう　こっちに　きてるの？▼
なによそれ　あいかわらずね
きめたら　すぐに　うごくんだから▼
うん！　ベルちゃんね！
おおきな　みどりの　ぼうし　っと▼
はいはい
だいじょうぶ！　だいじょうぶ！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-21T11:13:39" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-09T05:54:19" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>で　なあに？　その子ってば
もう　こっちに　来てるの？▼
なによそれ　あいかわらずね
決めたら　すぐに　行動なんだから▼
うん！　ベルちゃんね！
大きな　緑の　帽子っと▼
はいはい
大丈夫！　大丈夫！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-21T11:13:51" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-09T05:55:04" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♀
・オープニングデモ用</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-09T05:51:25" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>MAMA</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-09T05:51:14" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Importance">
			<Text>A</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-07T12:20:16" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#80ffff</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
